# Screen-share source picker.
#
# An app that offers windows as well as monitors (Telegram) makes xdpw skip
# slurp, which can only pick a monitor, and try wmenu/wofi/rofi/bemenu/mew/
# fuzzel instead. With none installed the share fails silently. The portal
# runs with PATH=/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin, hence the full path; xdpw runs the
# command through /bin/sh, which expands $HOME. Read only at startup:
#   systemctl --user restart xdg-desktop-portal-wlr
[screencast]
chooser_type=dmenu
chooser_cmd=$HOME/.local/bin/launcher --dmenu --prompt 'Share:'
